{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01269",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 5.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.33,
      "end_seconds": 12.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "You're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.78,
      "end_seconds": 20.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Honestly, it's my throat closing up, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.85,
      "end_seconds": 25.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.49,
      "end_seconds": 31.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "I'm on Asthalin inhaler, when needed for my asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.89,
      "end_seconds": 48.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.4,
      "end_seconds": 52.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "It's been two days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.48,
      "end_seconds": 55.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Ah. How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.66,
      "end_seconds": 60.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "It happens on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.93,
      "end_seconds": 64.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Okay, is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.63,
      "end_seconds": 83.9,
      "duration_seconds": 19.27,
      "text": "Hives all over goes along with it, most of the time. The hives all over? That's been for about a week. Oh, uh, and swollen lips. About swollen lips, it's on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.74,
      "end_seconds": 88.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "And what about recent illness or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.07,
      "end_seconds": 94.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.75,
      "end_seconds": 98.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.3,
      "end_seconds": 102.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.75,
      "end_seconds": 105.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.5,
      "end_seconds": 109.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.91,
      "end_seconds": 130.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.11,
      "end_seconds": 154.62,
      "duration_seconds": 22.51,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I have about eight cigarettes in a day. I hardly move around during the day. I retired from the post office two years ago. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.98,
      "end_seconds": 160.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.63,
      "end_seconds": 163.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "I've had asthma, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.62,
      "end_seconds": 182.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.82,
      "end_seconds": 189.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "I had keyhole surgery on my gallbladder two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.64,
      "end_seconds": 196.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.8,
      "text": "Okay, can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.22,
      "end_seconds": 212.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.78,
      "end_seconds": 231.37,
      "duration_seconds": 8.59,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 97 over 61, temperature 37.2, respiratory rate 16, heart rate 94, oxygen saturation is 96 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.76,
      "end_seconds": 238.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 239.51,
      "end_seconds": 240.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.65,
      "end_seconds": 243.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.75,
      "end_seconds": 264.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Your lips are swollen, you have hives, you are wheezing and your pressure is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.14,
      "end_seconds": 295.17,
      "duration_seconds": 26.03,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. I want monitoring done, that's for anaphylaxis. The treatment will be adrenaline, 0.5 milligrams, once now, single dose. That should help with anaphylaxis. Lie flat with your legs raised, I am giving the injection now. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.14,
      "end_seconds": 303.66,
      "duration_seconds": 7.52,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms return, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.52,
      "end_seconds": 307.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.49,
      "end_seconds": 312.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again straight away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.85,
      "end_seconds": 316.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.44,
      "end_seconds": 321.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.02,
      "end_seconds": 324.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.61,
      "end_seconds": 326.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}